    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. When you mention \"cultural friction\" and the \"dilution\" of character, are you suggesting that these demographic shifts tend to lead to a decline in property values or a rise in local crime rates? I've seen some older studies that link these specific types of transitions to a decrease in communal safety and economic stability. Can you expand on whether there's a pattern there?",
